Scoped hqx (hq2x/hq3x/hq4x) magnification filter

The n option, the output geometry (w*n by h*n), the single RGB32 pixel format, the rgbtoyuv
key (init, evaluated per pixel instead of tabulated), yuv_diff, interp_2px/interp_3px on the
whole 32-bit word, the INTERP_BOOTSTRAP mask shuffle, the hq2x_interp_1x1, hq3x_interp_2x1 and
hq4x_interp_2x2 pattern tables, their hqx_filter call sites and the edge replication in
src/video-hqx.ts and src/video-ops/hqx.ts follow libavfilter/vf_hqx.c (hqx_options, rgb2yuv,
yuv_diff, interp_2px, interp_3px, hq2x_interp_1x1, hq3x_interp_2x1, hq4x_interp_2x2, hqx_filter,
config_output, filter_frame, init, FILTER_SINGLE_PIXFMT).
